# Raised 75.0 -> 85.0 on 2026-09-01 after moving the entry point's Go logic
# out of the cgo shim into run() and testing it directly. Note for the next
# time this number moves without a source change: the `go` directive in
# go.mod moving 1.26 -> 1.27 changed how statements are counted, and cgo
# files got the worst of it -- pam_ssoossh.go went from 26 to 78 statements
# with no edit, which dropped this package from 76.7% to 61.4% overnight.
# The counting is toolchain-defined; the floor tracks whatever the current
# toolchain reports.
